sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Frontend
    participant AuthController
    participant Database

    User->>Frontend: Enter credentials
    Frontend->>AuthController: POST /login
    AuthController->>Database: Query user by email
    Database-->>AuthController: Return user & hash
    AuthController->>AuthController: Verify password
    alt Valid Credentials
        AuthController->>Database: Create session
        Database-->>AuthController: Session created
        AuthController-->>Frontend: Redirect to Dashboard (200 OK)
        Frontend-->>User: Display Dashboard
    else Invalid Credentials
        AuthController-->>Frontend: Redirect back with errors (302 Found)
        Frontend-->>User: Display error message
    end
